OL,3,GNEWSADelays to Gatwick train services
OL,4,Apersist after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains running between Gatwick Airport
OL,7,Fand Purley may be subject to delays
OL,8,Ffollowing a fire next to the track
OL,9,Fbetween the two stations on Tuesday
OL,10,Fmorning.
OL,12,FGatwick Express said that, while all
OL,13,Flines have reopened, journeys may take
OL,14,Fat least 30 minutes longer than usual,
OL,15,Fwith disruption expected until 11:45
OL,16,FBST.
OL,18,FPosting on social media just before
OL,19,F11:00, both Thameslink and Southern
OL,20,Furged passengers to allow an extra 15
OL,21,Fminutes for journeys.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
